  "applies_to": "Unipi Extension xG18 RS-485 module per the Unipi Extension xG18 Modbus map v1.1.",
  "summary": "The Unipi Extension xG18 is an RS-485 Modbus RTU gateway for up to eight Unipi 1-Wire temperature sensors, one per channel. The map gives each channel's temperature in hundredths of a degree, a validity bit word, measuring intervals, the master watchdog and RS-485 configuration.",
