      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 1010,
        "why": "CH1 measuring interval"
      },
      {
        "table": "holding_register",
        "address": 1019,
        "why": "Modbus address"
      }
    ],
    "enable": "Modbus RTU is the native interface; nothing needs enabling. Factory settings are address 15, 19200 bps, 8N1.",
    "watchdog": "Master watchdog (MWD): enable it with bit 0 of register 0 and set the timeout in register 1008 (default 5000 ms). A watchdog reboot is flagged in bit 1 of register 0 and in coil 1000; the map does not describe the timeout behaviour further.",
    "quirks": [
      "32-bit values (here only the PCB serial number) are low word first (CDAB).",
      "Changes to RS-485 settings and other configuration need the Save configuration coil to survive a power cycle."
    ],
    "setup": [
      "Set the address register (1019) and the packed RS-485 configuration register (1018), then write 1 to the save coil (1003) so the settings are used on startup."
    ],
    "gotchas": []
  },
